OL,3,GNEWSAShock and sadness after popular
OL,4,Atree is felled
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The tree was amazing - its crazy fairy
OL,7,Ftale shape, an iconic shape, and that's
OL,8,Fwhy everyone's so shocked that it's
OL,9,Fbeen suddenly removed."
OL,11,FPeople in Alfreton have been sharing
OL,12,Ftheir memories and expressing their
OL,13,Fsadness that a giant "bendy-branched"
OL,14,Fbeech tree has been chopped down.
OL,16,FVisitors to Alfreton Park, where the
OL,17,Ftree stood, described it as "beautiful
OL,18,Fand amazing," reminisced on the fun had
OL,19,Fon its unusual U-shaped lower branch
OL,20,Fand said they were surprised by
OL,21,FDerbyshire County Council's decision to
OL,22,Ftake it down on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
